 there's a question about how long we  can hold out  as they do get worse because they've  gotten bad at an incredible rate  all right well brendan this is  as always been a fascinating discussion  i hope it is the first of many  um people should find you  at the brendan o'neill show and on  spiked anywhere else  those are the main places yeah are you  still the last person  on earth with no twitter account i don't  use twitter but i  do use instagram so you do use instagram  all right cool um how do people find you  on instagram  my name is burnt oak boy that's b u  r n t o a  k b o y excellent  well thank you so much for visiting the  dark horse podcast  and uh i guess we'll stay tuned and see  what happens in the election  thanks brett all right be well brendan  [Music]  [Music]  you
 

